  <item>
    <title>番外篇上：聊红牛敢死队，于是我们跪着做完这期节目~</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63ad598a4ded9d81d0a11dfe</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63ad598a4ded9d81d0a11dfe</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 29 Dec 2022 09:10:34 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目我们斗胆从人类最强能力者“</span><strong><span>红牛敢死队</span></strong><span>“聊起，细数那些他们完成的”</span><strong><span>不可能任务</span></strong><span>“，只有你不敢想象的恐怖挑战，没有他们做不到的极致追求；一起陪他们疯狂探索这副人类的躯壳，到底可以燃烧到什么地步，如何</span><strong><span>徒手摘星辰</span></strong><span>；同时逐渐揭开极限运动背后金主的神秘面纱，一窥那庞大的体育文化帝国。</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>时间轴</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="133">02:13</a> 来自杨过和杨康的几个Tips</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="538">08:58</a> Red Bull Rampage红牛坠山赛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1088">18:08</a> 红牛特技飞行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1323">22:03</a> Red Bull Stratos红牛平流层计划</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1894">31:34</a> 资助民用GPS发展</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2007">33:27</a> F1赛场维修站之争</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2258">37:38</a> 红牛内马尔5人制足球赛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2463">41:03</a> 红牛电竞大布局</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuDtsuyQb1Jgb3_qr4IZR236PxTk.jpeg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>播客中提到的影片和视频</span></blockquote><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV13t411i7y1/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=cd2fc3ed4950a153a60971dda41523c7" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV13t411i7y1/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=cd2fc3ed4950a153a60971dda41523c7"><span>红牛极限运动全球敢死队员年终盘点</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1SN4y1w7YA/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=cd2fc3ed4950a153a60971dda41523c7" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1SN4y1w7YA/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=cd2fc3ed4950a153a60971dda41523c7"><span>红牛坠山赛2022年TOP3视频合集</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Rs411z7tY/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=cd2fc3ed4950a153a60971dda41523c7" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Rs411z7tY/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=cd2fc3ed4950a153a60971dda41523c7"><span>纪录片《车轮不息》《Where The Trail Ends》</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Th411R7WW/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=cd2fc3ed4950a153a60971dda41523c7" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Th411R7WW/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=cd2fc3ed4950a153a60971dda41523c7"><span>自由骑大电影《Accomplice》《同谋》</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Mt411h7YB/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=cd2fc3ed4950a153a60971dda41523c7" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Mt411h7YB/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=cd2fc3ed4950a153a60971dda41523c7"><span>自由骑大电影 《North of Nightfall》《日暮北极》</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/bangumi/play/ep119043?spm_id_from=333.788.recommend_more_video.0" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/bangumi/play/ep119043?spm_id_from=333.788.recommend_more_video.0"><span>纪录片《Space Dive》《太空惊险跳》</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV15T411g7u2/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=cd2fc3ed4950a153a60971dda41523c7" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV15T411g7u2/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=cd2fc3ed4950a153a60971dda41523c7"><span>2022红牛「移动的艺术」全球跑酷大赛-赛后纪录片</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1yJ411i7Ks/?spm_id_from=333.788.recommend_more_video.1&amp;vd_source=cd2fc3ed4950a153a60971dda41523c7" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1yJ411i7Ks/?spm_id_from=333.788.recommend_more_video.1&amp;vd_source=cd2fc3ed4950a153a60971dda41523c7"><span>红牛自由骑大神 Fabio Wibmer 《从里昂到巴黎》</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1yp4y1h73H/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=cd2fc3ed4950a153a60971dda41523c7" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1yp4y1h73H/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=cd2fc3ed4950a153a60971dda41523c7"><span>红牛自由骑大神 Fabio Wibmer 雪地速降大片《Escape 2》</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1cL411s7Gf/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=cd2fc3ed4950a153a60971dda41523c7" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1cL411s7Gf/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=cd2fc3ed4950a153a60971dda41523c7"><span>冲浪名人堂最年轻浪人Kai Lenny 纪录片《life of Kai》</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1x4411A7BJ/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=cd2fc3ed4950a153a60971dda41523c7" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1x4411A7BJ/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=cd2fc3ed4950a153a60971dda41523c7"><span>F1纪录片《维修站的历史》</span></a></p><span></span><blockquote><span>主播 / 黛跑跑</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>嘉宾 / 郑先森</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>后期 / 黛跑跑</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>文档整理 / 黛跑跑</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>封面设计 / Shawn</span></blockquote>]]></description>
