  <item>
    <title>EP03 中国户外徒步&amp;攀登雪山 此生必去线路大合集！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63835cc67105b234344c1179</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63835cc67105b234344c1179</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 28 Nov 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目嘉宾是国内TOP级户外俱乐部2位资深领队，他们的足迹遍布</span><strong><span>四川、滇南、新疆、西藏</span></strong><span>……流连过森林和草原、到达过神山和圣湖、抚摸过彩林和繁花、征服过雪山和冰川；我们一起把国内所有户外</span><strong><span>徒步露营</span></strong><span>，和</span><strong><span>攀登雪山</span></strong><span>的线路做一个大盘点，从地域地貌、一年四季、难度系数上逐个细数和讲解；争取为大家呈现出一幅祖国大好河山的优美画卷，也给大家整理出解封后，未来整整1年的户外出行安排。</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>PS：这次录制真的是太难了，领队被封控在家，我们分别在3个不同的地方，中间还被各种打断，于是我们录制了4次，然后需要对8段音频素材进行剪辑和拼凑，终于赶在周末完成；希望未来的我们，身体不再被困于弹丸，灵魂不再被束缚于方寸，自由！勇敢！平安！- 2022年11月26日记</span></em></p><span></span><blockquote><span>时间轴</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">01:50</a> 户外领队的要求有多高？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="249">04:09</a> 九月暴雪掩埋了我们的帐篷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="405">06:45</a> 唯一一座全境在我国的8000米级雪山</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="465">07:45</a> 水晶宫殿-冰塔林</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="620">10:20</a> 四川徒步露营线路盘点&amp;最推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="779">12:59</a> 云南徒步露营线路盘点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="843">14:03</a> 西藏徒步露营线路盘点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1003">16:43</a> 新疆徒步露营线路盘点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1143">19:03</a> 春天里那最浪漫的一整片粉色</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1247">20:47</a> 古老的蓝色冰川触手可及</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1367">22:47</a> 繁花丛中，一起看日落斜阳撸串</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a> 乌孙古道，历史的追溯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1538">25:38</a> 从你的全世界路过，带你去秋天的稻城</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1627">27:07</a> 走过那条彩色长廊，就遇见了仙境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1721">28:41</a> 攀登雪山，这里有一份全攻略</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2022">33:42</a> 以难度等级排名，盘点全川藏十大经典线路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2395">39:55</a> 有生之年，我想去一趟这里</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2682">44:42</a> 徒步可不能说走就走，需要这些准备工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2817">46:57</a> 基本的生存技能，请码住</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2970">49:30</a> 三招应对高原反应</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3222">53:42</a> 推荐一部超级震撼的纪录片</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqmYQ0SWkb6WvY9Jw11r2iqXnExp.jpeg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>延伸阅读</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>中国十大经典徒步线路：线路图解 &amp; 风景照赏析</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmVQthId9Z8il1LuNwzER-cHJyVi.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqHTeV11Zm9Bm1JGvk9XIwdN1dX2.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpzMOB3EdUWIH-fZzE9mD_vwqo0Q.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn0hMoqmcGbw2728VglsmgSzwVbr.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv_s1g87lKRhFFS-BmK7TD3IvQPo.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsDt23befXOKQ2CPtLbpH-6qtgBu.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnK6zBtDICH31jc95B-FRdGnB6s6.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FleyITcsKLKX9E-uXowgoeYJRm2_.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmWUqBtJLsXbspL36GK84OQPY_ry.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhQu8__UDJ8aYlGPkwQ2xzjzhD6z.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrHPOBdbsixZBh7GoHGqnPKzhXLs.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg-JdGcBi-RXnfhxYwE0dnTGFQ0p.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgqIwKVDfZpq_FAMESVVfe67t3og.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrY1h5wf6gY_xzi3XgR1ZdMYVwSi.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuoM6dGu3PsiykW7hhzpE755NLFS.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv4CZSDb-jdF8BA_oJvVr7alc3Hj.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgASE8SdZCDOzJEDOYcDQvzzl4gM.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgG2FY0UOtY4z2oMLL-6FfZTh-f4.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtVvgip4GlrXYhm-T6L_Yac-mTha.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft17_2riX5DBO_pOq8bdclLdcBSK.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj0Lg7b09EEChzhIXa_PAc9zV2oe.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqpgFErItczL1HO9QBuHq8BdP16f.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpxrSxOJwcgNDPeSIqYv6UssfDng.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtTgy_PauslGtNqse4aW_3AQtWbt.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fon2NYpOoj7HtnbJ11qsqWVWAKyj.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvbrZ0P5RBCn1792KQwb7SoObYbM.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoxuaTEJfUFZcmeFIUmABJ79VTn8.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjxDowmgtbBciDkZypl1eOfPbDRx.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FglUELuIHyuRaYXI9OuK4XsH3L1B.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqwigQCQ-oAgborwzms-qz8U7KEo.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj_73tO6KLHFKzoGgvS6B7bffRqJ.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp4z2MQMq4NVYO2nrkt22VwXDm7S.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoRS3nj_tiNB-HZogSCMQqme-XFk.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgeWB8ou2eFYM7A0nuQhXYSakOld.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkdd78qWslEvz24X8Px2YY-zZVT1.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtmWgs4u4sjhDuTNwm0OC5MFkqhi.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>主播 / 黛跑跑</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>后期 / 黛跑跑（我太难啦(ಥ_ಥ)）</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>文档整理 / 黛跑跑</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>封面设计 / Shawn</span></blockquote>]]></description>
