    <title>EP01 露营天花板现场！和陈伟霆一起露营是什么体验？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6357f3c9e67030aadb38fe81</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6357f3c9e67030aadb38fe81</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 26 Oct 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目嘉宾是今年大火的全网首档潮流户外真人秀综艺</span><strong><span>《一起露营吧》</span></strong><span>的总导演蔡尧，他将会用综艺节目的逻辑呈现给我们</span><strong><span>一本户外露营指南手册</span></strong><span>，一起聊聊节目中的天花板装备和目的地，以及他所热爱的这种生活方式。这中间我们也试图使用声音的魔法，提供一个</span><strong><span>沉浸式云露营</span></strong><span>的场景，尽量还原走进大自然的那份静谧和美好。</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>综艺介绍</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>《一起露营吧》是一档户外露营体验真人秀，由陈伟霆、黄雅莉、王子异、杨迪、钟楚曦、章若楠组成“露营家族”，通过5站2天1夜的旅途，带领观众走近大漠、雨林、草原、近郊、沙滩等不同的露营地，感受自然风景疗愈人心的力量，打开探索生活乐趣的新视角。刚刚在2022年亚洲学院创意奖上获得了中国大陆地区最佳生活方式。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvnqvG20GtgcZI1UVVdCtMOU6HYE.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>你会听到</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>大火的露营到底在玩什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>从新手到进阶，装备怎么选？</span></p><span></span><p><span>露营按风格分为几类？渊源和特质是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>地大物博，我们就选了这5种典型地貌去露营</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>时间轴</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="187">3:07</a> 拿下亚洲学院创意奖的《一起露营吧》到底是档什么节目？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="293">4:53</a> 露营行业大火背后的现象 &amp; 数据分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="458">7:38</a> 这里有本户外露营从新手到天花板的进阶指南</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="641">10:41</a> 新手必备，大部分人都买错了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="751">12:31</a> Snow Peak 雪峰IGT系列，还有平替</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="868">14:28</a> 买天幕的时候注意什么？推荐一个国货之光</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="983">16:23</a> 过夜的帐篷，我家4口人买了个四人帐，怎么不对呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1061">17:41</a> 睡袋这种保命之物，你真的会选吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1361">22:41</a> 零下30度的极端天气，帐篷里还能穿短袖，靠的是它</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1543">25:43</a> 推荐几款制造氛围的高颜值小物件</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1672">27:52</a> 露营装备一般分几类？细细和你说说</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a> Glamping的起源</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1804">30:04</a> 浅谈一下大白熊NORDISK和Tentipi这两个户外品牌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1919">31:59</a> 深扒最爱的BC风格，够胆才能入坑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2142">35:42</a> 推荐一块砖，在上面烤肉可以不用放盐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2211">36:51</a> 沉浸式云体验……前方预警，这段可能会听着听着睡着了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2415">40:15</a> 和陈伟霆一起睡帐篷是什么体验？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2648">44:08</a>5站选了5种地貌特征，玩着玩着就升级了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2795">46:35</a> 还有2个遗珠推荐，上海的朋友有福了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3040">50:40</a> 长沙本地人推荐几个露营的好去处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3258">54:18</a> 尧叔和Wagon的故事，他说自己是盆栽组？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3507">58:27</a> 第二季的小剧透：究极版露营玩家玩什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3655">1:00:55</a>第一季在哪里可以看到？</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>延伸阅读</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><strong><span>Snow Peak雪峰</span></strong><span>，源自日本，由山井幸雄在1958年所创立，品牌口号是“人生就是野营”，是顶级的户外品牌。作为全球范围内汽车露营的开创者以及户外野营的引领者，Snow Peak早已不止于露营，从露营延展到生活方式，以其独特的日式美学和产品品质被称为"露营界的LV". 旗下有25个产品品类，多达600余个SKU，户外服饰价格均上千元，帐篷类更是五千甚至上万元，最畅销的钛金属杯算是价格友好，售价169元。更是在日本长野开出了一家Snow Peak LAND STATION HAKUBA，由日本知名建筑师隈研吾操刀设计，打造首个以户外为主题的综合性旅游设施。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiBT04GLwExC58iE0ZC9Ai82Dig6.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>Nordisk 大白熊</span></strong><span>，源自丹麦，1901年创立于丹麦的哥本哈根，以超轻紧凑的徒步旅行装备和极致奢华的装备而闻名，最经典的白色复古帆布帐篷，材料厚实结合科技防水防风，浓郁的斯堪的纳维亚风格，兼顾功能和颜值。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpQ7SQ3Je6aYdeO6nAwhyQXEhWqX.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>Tentipi 特恩迪贝</span></strong><span>，源自瑞典，1989年创立于瑞典北部一个叫Moskosel的小村庄，由于其创始人想要一顶可以在里面生火，做饭，保暖并远离蚊虫的帐篷而诞生。标识产品就是锥形帐篷，可应付极端气候条件，无论是在冰川顶端，甚至极圈、冰场、暴风、暴雨，即便是炎热的天气都适用。就算遇到突然接近的龙卷风，也能快速应变拔营迁移。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvCsP1GBTME-8oFbGMSB8FrAah-W.jpeg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>嘉宾简介</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>蔡尧，鱼子酱旗下综艺制作人，《一起露营吧》和《青春的花路》总导演</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fktg4G3SaTU5-g19PSFmB7aiGAIM.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>露营装备天花板赏析</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjaGRSRnKSubK2SEBNxrFY1_7FS0.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjuvDSDBadD9FrHUo48DQGMRMAlM.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjNTtNl5aGL_ThPaGxPO-Oc68mp4.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnYLZxDAaL82ziftjSZ78_PzduER.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnRBritjebSwNVMUbvZ_MkyY231a.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmSySF1xueDG4RbVbcsGvbh9jkho.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoOrNbzn_YE9FeDtAvYwM5Hq7m0O.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Foopr82ECu1faJa7H-Vw6WiK0gUk.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi1rzx-sEfovWlMrC4OwVO_A3CSw.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fque1_nqvAHak64GPQrTegb3aFZ9.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjULp9s_FX4apUwr3-X2enPaxliw.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm96iKZzPuv3r4AlRqn4N-szc8-b.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg2EZ1orgQaeTo1zlVNHDUWg4GSR.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuJW7E4HNHnIamDDZV8jehLjdsjt.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo8R0B8iJmxccYk5QxpmXexv6NyY.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkFmNfo3dMQo7lzY0hXXuyn4ffNf.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft-62yl7mLAEI2GiexK1Jtw_RZMB.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvuGT-xhBqq77_h-TPLxHsdlF_B8.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk9ZxnYdVU4Dna97t8LM7Q6ME378.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm2YmPwhyLLEN03llM7xPyWV-_xj.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvPHAIXoeiBoMWHXLqu3DCZ5fDUL.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>(以上整理来自小红书账号"一帐Camplus")</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>露营出行备忘录</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmaweniztj8UqpPXGiYUQdxzeYaV.png"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>上海露营地合集</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fskoc27weBn2McAhDHmA--TfB5rS.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi3uv5g50nYGqGFWpuXI3Npd1WTd.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpC_ssXlqPC99hrK-Htnk2AumsfH.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhKub9bHnqIvk8yOh8RiNoaq7Mhf.JPG"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>主播 / 黛跑跑</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>后期 / 黛跑跑 &amp; Shawn</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>文档整理 / 黛跑跑</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>封面设计 / Shawn</span></blockquote>]]></description>
