    <title>EP00 先导片 | 户外卷王争霸赛，不服来战！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63517f0e9186d4e4c46a15b0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63517f0e9186d4e4c46a15b0</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 21 Oct 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目先做个热身，邀请两位户外运动圈的硬核玩家杰哥和Zack，一起聊聊又刺激又难忘的户外亲身经历。</span></p><span></span><p><span>| </span><strong><span>你会听到</span></strong><span> |</span></p><span></span><p><span>潜水、滑雪、徒步、浆板、攀登雪山、翼装飞行、山地速降、洞穴探险、城市骑行……</span></p><span></span><p><span>| </span><strong><span>时间轴</span></strong><span> |</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目中谈及到的运动及地名具体如下：</span></p><span></span><p><span>1) 徒步：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="337">5:37</a> 尼泊尔– ABC线指安娜普尔纳大本营线（Annapurna Base Camp）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="401">6:41</a> 尼泊尔– EBC线指珠峰大本营环线（Everest Base Camp）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="470">7:50</a> 克什米尔地区的拉达克– 赞斯卡冰河线路（Zanskar, Chadar Trek）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="531">8:51</a> 巴塔哥尼亚地区Patagonia，智利 – 百内国家公园W线路（Torres del Paine National Park）</span></p><span></span><p><span>2) 潜水&amp;攀岩&amp;皮划艇：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="629">10:29</a> 菲律宾巴拉望爱妮岛（El Nido, Palawan）</span></p><span></span><p><span>3) 滑雪：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="875">14:35</a> 美国科罗拉多丹佛Denver – 有爱之地滑雪场（Love Land Valley/ Basin）</span></p><span></span><p><span>4) 轻徒步：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="993">16:33</a> 加拿大西部：班夫国家公园（Banff），贾斯帕国家公园（Jasper），哥伦比亚冰原（Columbia Icefield），幽鹤国家公园（Yoho），库特尼国家公园（Kootenay）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> 美国西部：黄石国家公园（Yellowstone），大提顿国家公园（Grand Teton），大峡谷国家公园（Grand Canyon），拱门国家公园（Arches），布莱斯峡谷国家公园（Bryce Canyon）</span></p><span></span><p><span>5) 潜水：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1191">19:51</a> 珊瑚礁三角区：以吕宋岛、苏门答腊岛、新几内亚岛为顶点之间的水域</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1240">20:40</a> 冲绳，与那国岛- 锤头鲨风暴；澳大利亚&amp;斐济 - 鲨鱼；汤加 – 大翅鲸；菲律宾 – 鲸鲨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1434">23:54</a> 马来西亚，诗巴丹- 海狼鱼风暴</span></p><span></span><p><span>6) 追极光：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1601">26:41</a> 芬兰，罗瓦涅米（Rovaniemi）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1713">28:33</a> 冰岛，蓝湖（Blue Lagoon）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1753">29:13</a> 瑞典，阿比斯库（Abiscu National Park）</span></p><span></span><p><span>7) 翼装飞行：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1871">31:11</a> 湖南省，张家界，天门山</span></p><span></span><p><span>8) 山地速降：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1900">31:40</a> 加拿大库特尼地区，戈尔登山（Golden）</span></p><span></span><p><span>9) 洞穴潜水：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1998">33:18</a> 墨西哥，图卢姆（Tulum）</span></p><span></span><p><span>10) 攀登雪山：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2123">35:23</a> 四川省，贡嘎地区，那玛峰，海拔5588米（技术性攀登入门款）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2123">35:23</a> 四川省，毕棚沟地区，半脊峰，海波5430米</span></p><span></span><p><span>11) 洞穴探险：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2444">40:44</a> 贵州省，荔波县 – SRT（Single Rope Technique）单绳技术</span></p><span></span><p><span>12) 城市户外：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2653">44:13</a> 骑行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2846">47:26</a> 浆板 - 上海，新江湾城</span></p><span></span><p><span>| 主播和嘉宾的照片分享 |</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lghyE5uXhzz8__c8-3AGvz53yfqR.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>百内国家公园</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lk1-QiyHvBsv0bj5l0kaqlDpgIpt.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>百内国家公园</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lk0tOEJ9WCMqTPBogXN47pUWUpft.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>赞斯卡河</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lqW6eUKmi4IcQtm72Uv9uTjNP7vC.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>水下微距摄影：海马</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ltGxg-JQ7tNAoEsXMYF3Z3EOUPAn.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>水下微距摄影：虾</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgzsxbLwHZGqtRuJ7LjqEasTm45a.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>黄石国家公园</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/luzdLN1IAnmHrR_5rxlntE86F01M.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>大提顿国家公园</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flb7CyR1um2-RxtcwuIPYJhJah2N.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>极光</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fogs_62MRNs2EasGJwJ5S5HyaVyv.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>滑雪中的Zack</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lmg5vnWVH0aQ0YdZ_zcsoK8GeAS1.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>攀登半脊峰的Zack</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播 / 黛跑跑</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期 / 黛跑跑 &amp; Shawn</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面设计 / Shawn</span></p>]]></description>
